--cpp20
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ 1 <=> 2 is less: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ 5 <=> 5 is equal: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] line \d+ 9 <=> 4 greater: SUCCESS$
