--
^CONVERSION ERROR$
invalid implicit conversion
--
N5008 [expr.spaceship]/8: a built-in three-way comparison of integral operands
yields std::strong_ordering (not int).  Previously CBMC lowered builtin a<=>b to
an int, so binding the result to std::strong_ordering raised a CONVERSION ERROR.
